            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Let's talk about ergonomics. For T3, I've started a draft of the workstation checklist A2. My initial thoughts are: 1. Adjust chair/mat height, 2. Parts bins within easy reach, 3. Floor clear of trip hazards. What else should be on there?",
