            "text": "Good question @81330. It means you shouldn't have to over-extend or twist your body to grab a part. I'll rephrase it in A2 to be clearer, maybe 'All parts bins can be reached without leaning or twisting'. And great point @87884, I'll add a 'Use safe lifting posture' check.",
