        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 371640,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team. As we start the pilot, I need to clarify how the time spent on these new routines will be recorded for payroll. This is for T7. If we don't track it, we can't measure the project's impact on downtime. How should we code the time spent on the standardized changeover?",
