            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 371640,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "For accurate reporting and to handle any potential overtime correctly, it's better to have a specific code. I propose we create a new job code, 'PILOT-CHANGEOVER', for assemblers on Line 3 to use only when performing the new procedure. This will keep the data clean.",
